@startuml
[*] --> Shut Down : Initial State
Shut Down --> Running : Restart
Running --> Configuration Mode : Changes or Power-Saving Settings Required
Configuration Mode --> Running : Configuration Completed
Running --> Running : Clock Trigger, Data Collection
Running --> Running : Request for Weather Summary, Prepare and Send Out
Running --> Running : Request for System Status, Check and Transmit Result
Running --> Controlled Mode : Remote Control
Running --> Shut Down : Shutdown Command

Controlled Mode --> Shut Down : Shutdown Command (Implicit)

[*] --> Shut Down : Final State
@enduml
